>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYGUARD.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE                     PIC X(512).
01 EXPECTED-TEXT                  PIC X(20).
01 ACTUAL-TEXT                    PIC X(20).
01 KIND                           PIC X(24).
01 EXPECTED-VALUE                 PIC 9(14).
01 ACTUAL-VALUE                   PIC 9(14).
01 OUTPUT-CODE                    PIC X(32).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO KIND EXPECTED-TEXT ACTUAL-TEXT
    END-UNSTRING
    COMPUTE EXPECTED-VALUE = FUNCTION NUMVAL(EXPECTED-TEXT)
    COMPUTE ACTUAL-VALUE = FUNCTION NUMVAL(ACTUAL-TEXT)
    IF EXPECTED-VALUE = ACTUAL-VALUE
        MOVE "CONSISTENT" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    ELSE
        MOVE "INCONSISTENT" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUTPUT-CODE)
    STOP RUN.
